Package: ffdraft
Title: Local Fantasy Football Draft Engine
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Jason", "Grahn", email = "jasongrahn@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A local, config-driven fantasy football draft engine that optimizes
    for P(championship) under a specific league's scoring and roster rules,
    rather than producing generic rankings.
